 Gift","The Mórrigan's Guidance","Sacred Unity","The Natural Order","Vivid Stampede","Primal Bounty","Idolatry","Wild Protector"]},{"n":"Gemling Legionnaire","id":"Gemling Legionnaire","class":"Mercenary","qt":"The more you embrace virtue gems, the more power they offer...","img":"n:passives/gemling/gemlingnode.webp","notables":["Essence of Virtue","Advanced Thaumaturgy","Gem Studded","Thaumaturgical Infusion","Adaptive Capability","Integrated Efficiency","Enhanced Effectiveness"],"missing":["Implanted Gems"]},{"n":"Tactician","id":"Tactician","class":"Mercenary","qt":"Countless wars have left you with skills somewhat resembling a decent officer...","img":"n:passives/tactician/tacticiannode.webp","notables":["Unleash Hell!","Strategic Embankments","Whoever Pays Best","A Solid Plan","Watch How I Do It","Stay Light, Use Cover","Cannons, Ready!","Polish That Gear","Suppressing Fire","Right Where We Want Them"]},{"n":"Witchhunter","id":"Witchhunter","class":"Mercenary","qt":"There's something very wrong with this world... and you're going to fix it.","img":"n:passives/witchhunter/witchunternode.webp","notables":["Witchbane","Ceremonial Ablution","Weapon Master","Judge, Jury, and Executioner","Zealous Inquisition","Obsessive Rituals","No Mercy","Pitiless Killer"]},{"n":"Acolyte of Chayula","id":"Acolyte of Chayula","class":"Monk","qt":"The truth of your faith threatens to break your very soul... but in that struggle lies power beyond belief.","img":"n:passives/acolyteofchayula/acolyteofchayulanode.webp","notables":["Unravelling","Inner Turmoil","Sap of Nightmares","Grasp of the Void","Archon of Chayula","Deepening Shadows","Embrace the Darkness","Waking Dream","Chayula's Gift"],"missing":["Lucid Dreaming"]},{"n":"Invoker","id":"Invoker","class":"Monk","qt":"True strength lies within. One must only focus... and believe.","img":"n:passives/invoker/invokernode.webp","notables":["I am the Thunder...","Lead me through Grace...","Faith is a Choice","I am the Blizzard...","...a